{"id":8746462,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/3370","number":3370,"state":"merged","title":"fix(cdist_grad): 修复反向梯度计算产生 NaN","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/3370","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/3370/issues","body":"## 描述\n修复 `cdist_grad`（arch35）反向梯度计算中产生 NaN 的问题。\n\n**根因**：梯度计算先求 `ratio = |diff| / (cdist + eps)`，再通过 `exp(log(ratio) * (p-1))` 计算 `(ratio)^(p-1)`。当前向 `cdist` 下溢为 0（大 p 或 |diff| 极小）时，`ratio = |diff| / eps` 爆炸 → `exp` 上溢为 `+inf` → 尾部 mask 做 `inf * 0` 产生 NaN。\n\n**修复**：在求 ratio 之前，先用 `cdist != 0` 的 mask 将 `|diff|` 置零（`|diff|_masked = |diff| * mask_cdist`），使 `ratio = 0 → pow_ratio = 0 → result = 0`，对齐 PyTorch CPU 上 `dist == 0` 时短路返回 0 的语义。\n\n涉及 `CdistGradDag` 与 `CdistGradLargePDag` 两处等价修改，改动文件：`math/cdist_grad/op_kernel/arch35/cdist_grad_dag.h`。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n#2096\n\n## 测试\n使用复现 NaN 的 p / shape 组合跑 `cdist_grad` 算子 ST 泛化用例，与 PyTorch CPU 对比：修复后输出不再出现 NaN，且结果精度对齐。\n\n## 文档更新\n无\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n","assignees_number":0,"assignees":[],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[],"labels":[{"id":4929,"color":"#2865E0","name":"cann-cla/yes","repository_id":7649531,"created_at":"2025-06-21T10:53:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-16T16:01:38+08:00"},{"id":22553,"color":"#3ee029","name":"api-check-pass","repository_id":7649531,"created_at":"2025-12-16T09:45:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T21:46:03+08:00"},{"id":3873,"color":"#21BA45","name":"ci-pipeline-passed","repository_id":7649531,"created_at":"2025-06-10T14:17:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T21:46:44+08:00"},{"id":2742,"color":"#22ed07","name":"approved","repository_id":7649531,"created_at":"2025-05-29T20:14:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-30T22:16:17+08:00"},{"id":2741,"color":"#17f207","name":"lgtm","repository_id":7649531,"created_at":"2025-05-29T20:14:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T09:17:27+08:00"}],"created_at":"2026-06-16T16:01:23+08:00","updated_a